<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand is responding to a bomb explosion in its southern region by tightening border security, while an explosion at an oil facility in Bangkok injured nine people. Cambodia lodged a formal protest over a Thai road expansion in Oddar Meanchey and the two countries agreed to a UN-backed site visit to address a disputed sea border. Thailand and Myanmar are pressing each other over arsenic contamination from Shan State mines, which is disrupting the Festival of Lights and prompting joint monitoring. A Japanese aid worker urged better integration of Myanmar migrants in Thailand. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOTGtxUEFnb0luRTIxQWdKN2wxZi1GU2RfMGY0ZElZZ0JvZWRrWE1BNzMtQ0tKR21LQVVXRXpwNV9TSlphTkFvZEwyT2U2dE5LT3hvYnVFeFRPNmZVT21xb2gtTnpGbktiZDhrVmZnNnEyT0VFVlczNXZHcHpwZGUySWtyZ1NkUVJUNmU2NzdTMkI3eTJ1czg5eDN4WUxfNFZSM0p3VnJjRXpqc3M1N1FLcXctaFo?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1LVG1NcldVekYwSUJjRk11d1oxVEtvbUVnNjdZandPOXF1Zno2a1BlNFNhdVk0Wk1ObHRpWkZSM2lFZlFiaW1KZ3ItRmlQN0hMVkVRUUd0UHhSWmFiMEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE9EdVgyM0dSZDA4MXFYeGJhV1htNTVlSFlpSHBYTllhOFc0a1VZUnZ2WVU0QkdienQtR09DX1VKa1NRdHotS3hXTTBHUzUxbHhNVllBQ2FaNkFTTmtVa0YyWnlR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQYlJ1N1VEYW02NllIbUNfaW1xQ09NQlp1TFJSVndWcmZrbTdmZWFQd2p3R1F3VE9kZFUzQzMyREdLanRHRllfVTRNTEgzdHJBNWl2T3dDbzZLdmtFSWcwT3d6R1MtQUk3dHM4am1MVFhweFZHT0VwZ2MtNEIwY2k1RnhkQ2pqM3c2YVJoNHBNYnZQRDh0czdmcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mining.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https: